# An LLM spec critic that runs as a subagent inside your Claude Code session, from the prompt in
# spec-critic.md (copied next to this file by `acfw-spec add spec-critic`). No key, no network of
# its own: it uses your session. Agent tools run at the plan stage only.
# It costs a subagent per run, so it reviews on the first card and again when you reply "review".
# It can also act as a workbench: /whip --push asks it to draft a revised plan, /whip --pull merges
# that draft into your plan with a 3-way merge that keeps your own edits.
agent=spec-critic.md
at=plan
policy=advisory
rerun=ask
